From: joebereczki <41107035-joebereczki@users.noreply.replit.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Feb 2026 07:09:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 010/244] Forcefully restart the gateway process to ensure a
 clean startup

Update the start script to kill existing gateway processes before starting a new one.

Replit-Commit-Author: Agent
Replit-Commit-Session-Id: ec0db605-e461-43a1-8678-7de14faee181
Replit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint
Replit-Commit-Event-Id: ae701879-b4d5-4558-8633-056a0f22c03f
Replit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/be1a940b-924a-449d-ae02-954c66974b04/ec0db605-e461-43a1-8678-7de14faee181/Jk3YN42
Replit-Helium-Checkpoint-Created: true
---
 start.sh | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/start.sh b/start.sh
index cccef39f4..e44cb9dde 100755
--- a/start.sh
+++ b/start.sh
@@ -1,4 +1,9 @@
 #!/bin/bash
+
+# Force kill any existing gateway processes first
+pkill -9 -f "node dist/entry.js gateway" 2>/dev/null || true
+sleep 0.5
+
 TOKEN="${OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN}"
 TOKEN_JS="/home/runner/workspace/dist/control-ui/token-init.js"
 
